# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# Eikonal variant on the pig Purkinje tree (Allrun eikonal pig).
#
# Single steady solve, writes only time 1 (see injection.eikonal.reference).
# The pig tree reaches this probe 2.63 ms later than the human tree
# (0.00736077): its junctions near the probe sit at different positions and
# mostly inside the wall. The eikonal coupling has no source-sink load, so
# the delay is geometric only.
#
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  1      2  0.00999277    1e-4
probe  postProcessing/eikonalECG.dat                   0.025  5  0.00130720262   2e-4
probe  postProcessing/eikonalECG.dat                   0.035  3  0.00340388839  2e-4
probe  postProcessing/eikonalECG.dat                   0.04   7  0.00341974394   2e-4
